- How would you test hot-swap safety under high concurrency?
- How would you implement async token replenishment without blocking request handling?
- What metrics would you expose for monitoring rate limiter effectiveness?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests the ability to design a runtime-extensible logging pipeline and to separate concerns via a plugin/registry pattern, while ensuring non-blocking behavior and per-channel configuration.

## Key Concepts

