## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design for runtime extensibility and clean separation between core i18n logic and providers.

## Key Concepts

- Strategy pattern for translation providers
- Registry for dynamic binding and hot-swapping
- Lazy resolution and caching to minimize lookups

## Code Example

